OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786636100
OL,3,CTrump announces White House press
OL,4,Csecretary Karoline Leavitt will leave
OL,5,Crole
OL,7,FWhite House press secretary Karoline
OL,8,FLeavitt will leave the administration
OL,9,Fat the end of the month to spend more
OL,10,Ftime with her family, President Donald
OL,11,FTrump announced on Wednesday.
OL,13,FLeavitt served Trump as a press aide
OL,14,Fduring his first term in the White
OL,15,FHouse and has been one of the most
OL,16,Fvisible advocates of his "Make America
OL,17,FGreat Again" movement.
OL,19,FAt 28, she is the youngest person to
OL,20,Fhave held the role.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/6
