OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786636100
OL,3,CTrump announces White House press
OL,4,Csecretary Karoline Leavitt will leave
OL,5,Crole
OL,7,FThe Republican president described her
OL,8,Fas one of his "most trusted aides" in
OL,9,Fa social media post announcing her
OL,10,Fdeparture.
OL,12,F"Our wonderful White House Press
OL,13,FSecretary, and one of my most trusted
OL,14,Faides, Karoline Leavitt, will be
OL,15,Fdeparting her role at the end of the
OL,16,Fmonth so she can spend more time with
OL,17,Fher beautiful young children and
OL,18,Ffamily, a decision I totally
OL,19,Funderstand and respect!" Trump wrote
OL,20,Fon Truth Social.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
