PN,31503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786636100
OL,3,CTrump announces White House press
OL,4,Csecretary Karoline Leavitt will leave
OL,5,Crole
OL,7,F"Karoline will now be one of my top
OL,8,Foutside advisors, and an influential
OL,9,Fvoice within the Republican Party, as
OL,10,Fwe work to defy History, and
OL,11,Fconclusively win the Midterm
OL,12,FElections."
OL,14,FTrump added that Leavitt had been a
OL,15,F"real leader in the White House", who
OL,16,Fhad done "a phenomenal job fighting
OL,17,Ffor Justice, Liberty, and Freedom,
OL,18,Fsince 2018".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
