PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786636100
OL,3,CTrump announces White House press
OL,4,Csecretary Karoline Leavitt will leave
OL,5,Crole
OL,7,FLeavitt recently returned to work
OL,8,Fafter taking a short leave following
OL,9,Fthe birth of her second child,
OL,10,FViviana, in May.
OL,12,FShe is also mum to a two-year-old son,
OL,13,FNicholas, who she shares with her
OL,14,Fhusband Nicholas Riccio, 60.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
