PN,31505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786636100
OL,3,CTrump announces White House press
OL,4,Csecretary Karoline Leavitt will leave
OL,5,Crole
OL,7,F"The truth is since returning to the
OL,8,FWhite House after the birth of my
OL,9,Fdaughter, I have felt in my heart that
OL,10,FI cannot be the best mom my two young
OL,11,Fchildren deserve while devoting the
OL,12,Fconstant time, energy, and attention
OL,13,Frequired of the White House Press
OL,14,FSecretary - and that is why I have
OL,15,Fultimately made the bittersweet
OL,16,Fdecision to depart the White House and
OL,17,Fembark on a new chapter in my life,"
OL,18,FLeavitt said in a social media post.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
